    kalp pompal\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bilsin! Sen beyninden gelen, mant\u0131kl\u0131
    olan, zay\u0131f \xE7\u0131kan, duymas\u0131 ve uymas\u0131 zor olan sesi dinle.
    O sana kazand\u0131r\u0131r."
